{"html":"<div><div> \n</div><p>Learn how to properly connect and set up the Air Purifier for your <a href=\"https://www.1laser.com/collections/x-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">X Series machine</a>, including installation, power connection, and airflow adjustment for optimal performance.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h-1-preparation\"> 1. Preparation</h2>\n<p>Consumable preparation:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>One Laser X model device x 1</li>\n  <li>Air Purifier x 1</li>\n  <li>Phillips screwdriver x 1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Debug software: None</p>\n<h2 id=\"h-2-operation-step\"> 2. Operation step</h2>\n<p><strong>Step 1. </strong>Install the equipment air duct to the air inlet of the purifier</p>\n<p>Use a cross screwdriver to tighten the hose clamp.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/use_a_cross_screwdriver_to_tighten_the_hose_clamp.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"Use a cross screwdriver to tighten the hose clamp\"></figure>\n<p><strong>Step 2. </strong>Connect the purifier to the power supply</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/connect_the_purifier_to_the_power_supply.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"Connect the purifier to the power supply\"></figure>\n<p><strong>Step 3.</strong> Turn on the power of the purifier, start the purifier, and adjust the air volume to the highest.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/turn_on_the_power_of_the_purifier.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"Turn on the power of the purifier\"></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/start_the_purifier.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"start the purifier\"></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/set-up/adjust_the_air_volume_to_the_highest.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"adjust the air volume to the highest\"></figure>\n</div>","toc":[{"id":"h-1-preparation","level":2,"text":"1. Preparation"},{"id":"h-2-operation-step","level":2,"text":"2. Operation step"}]}